  "question": {
    "text": "If \\(\\int \\frac{2 \\cos x-\\sin x+\\lambda}{\\cos x+\\sin x-2} d x\\) \\(=A \\ln |\\cos x+\\sin x-2|+B x+C\\).\nThen the ordered triplet \\(A, B, \\lambda\\) is -",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "hCv7z",
      "text": "\\(\\left(\\frac{1}{2}, \\frac{3}{2},-1\\right)\\)",
